{"u": "10769466346", "name": "Obby To Heaven! [120 Stages!]", "place": "112153632295482", "created": "2026-10-05", "updated": "2026-11-03T22:04:54.06Z", "genre": "Obby & Platformer", "subgenre": "Tower Obby", "desc": "🌟 OBBY TO HEAVEN! 🌟\n\nStart in the Underworld. Finish above the clouds. Can you make it all the way to Heaven?\n\n🔥 Escape the lava-filled UNDERWORLD\n🦴 Climb across ancient bones in the DESERT\n🐙 Find your footing in the OCEAN\n🌈 Brave the rainbow paths of the SKY\n✨ Reach HEAVEN… and discover what’s waiting for you!\n\n\n⭐ 120 stages on one massive spiral climb\n⭐ Different obstacles in every world\n⭐ Tougher challenges the higher you go\n⭐ Checkpoints save your progress along the way!\n\n\n☁️ THE CLIMB IS ONLY THE BEGINNING…\nEarn your first halo, then climb again to unlock more rewards! Collect a Cloud Fox, Sunrise Trail, Seraph Wings, and the Starglider across your first 5 finishes.\nHeaven has a few more surprises… but you’ll have to reach it to see them. 👀\n\n💛 Bring a friend and see who reaches the top first!\n👍 Enjoying the climb? Like and ⭐ favorite to support the game!\n\n\n\ntags: obby, parkour, tower, climb, heaven, underworld, ocean, casual, fun, fun obby, checkpoints, mobile, spiral, ", "desc_hash": "b2136df567c5", "max_players": 8, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 1383595, "favorites": 9724, "creator": {"id": 312207569, "name": "Moya Games", "type": "Group", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-11-03": {"updated": "2026-11-03T22:04:54.06Z", "visits": 1383595, "fav": 9724, "up": 1574, "down": 515}}, "passes": [{"name": "Magic Carpet", "price": 400}, {"name": "Speed Coil", "price": 99}, {"name": "Gravity Coil", "price": 99}, {"name": "Jetpack", "price": 450}, {"name": "Super Double Jump", "price": 99}, {"name": "Grapple", "price": 150}, {"name": "Boombox", "price": 25}, {"name": "Afterimage Trail", "price": 50}, {"name": "Transcendent Aura", "price": 50}, {"name": "Cloud Bunny", "price": 25}, {"name": "Galaxy